on exitFrame me
  [  0] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [  3] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <2>
  [  5] extcall 94 .............................. go(2)
  [  8] ret
end

on enterFrame me
  [  0] pushint8 13 ............................. <13>
  [  3] pusharglist 1 ........................... <13>
  [  5] extcall 47 .............................. <sprite(13)>
  [  8] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 11] setobjprop 57 ........................... sprite(13).visible = 1
  [ 14] pushint8 13 ............................. <13>
  [ 17] pusharglist 1 ........................... <13>
  [ 19] extcall 47 .............................. <sprite(13)>
  [ 22] pushint8 153 ............................ <153>
  [ 25] setobjprop 62 ........................... sprite(13).locH = 153
  [ 28] pushint8 13 ............................. <13>
  [ 31] pusharglist 1 ........................... <13>
  [ 33] extcall 47 .............................. <sprite(13)>
  [ 36] pushint8 237 ............................ <237>
  [ 39] setobjprop 63 ........................... sprite(13).locV = 237
  [ 42] ret
end
